# brain/ runtime artifacts (see brain/README.md): generated fresh by
# brain/auto_loop.mjs, brain/run_win.mjs, or a brain.test.mjs run. Never
# source — ignored so a clone + a local test/experiment run never shows up
# as a dirty working tree, and nobody mistakes someone else's play session
# for a source change in a diff/PR.
/decisions.jsonl
/pending_confirm.jsonl
/confirm_audit.jsonl
/policy_snapshot.json
/agent-work-2/

# brain/claim_bridge.mjs's optional agent-claim-memory integration: runtime
# claim store (pitfall claims, ledgers), generated fresh by
# brain/auto_loop.mjs / brain/run_win.mjs / brain/brain.test.mjs. Same
# "never source" rule as decisions.jsonl/policy_snapshot.json above.
/claim-memory-data/
